config RING_RELAY_LOGIC
	bool "Ring relay logic: frames and records of the relay service (pure)"
	select RING_INBOX
	help
	  No kernel, driver or Bluetooth call.

config RING_RELAY
	bool "Ring relay: notifications from a helper app on an Android phone"
	select RING_RELAY_LOGIC
	select RING_IPHONE
	depends on BT_PERIPHERAL && BT_SMP
	help
	  A Bluetooth service of the ring (design/firmware.md section 7.7) that accepts notifications
	  from a helper app and puts them in the same store as the iPhone's. Nothing received here can
	  start or stop a recording, and nothing here calls the core.

config RING_RELAY_TEST_HOOKS
	bool "Ring relay test hooks (tests only)"
	depends on RING_RELAY
	default n
	help
	  Lets a test block the Out queue. Never set in the product (tools/build_all.sh checks the product's settings).
